# v1.20.0 (S23) Wiki-link autocomplete: the bar shows right after [[ with
# the recent notes, narrows as letters are typed, a tap completes the link;
# after # it lists that note's headings (Forma 1440x1920).
open-fixture tests/emu/fixtures/lamps.md
open-fixture tests/emu/fixtures/markdown-tour.md
tap-on Files
tap-on New note
clear-field
type links
tap-on OK
# Notes opened from Files are the recent ones.
tap-on Files
tap-on lamps.md
tap-on Files
tap-on markdown-tour.md
tap-on Files
tap-on links.md
# Right after [[ the bar shows the recent notes, before any letter.
hw See [[
shot v1.20-wiki-recent
type la
shot v1.20-wiki-narrowed
# A tap completes and closes the link; the caret is after it.
tap-on Suggest0
expect See [[lamps]]
expect-caret-after [[lamps]]
shot v1.20-wiki-picked
# After # the chips are that note's headings, narrowed the same way.
hw  and [[markdown-tour#
shot v1.20-wiki-headings
type pa
shot v1.20-wiki-headings-narrowed
tap-on Suggest0
expect [[markdown-tour#Paging]]
# USB: Right moves the choice, Enter picks it.
hw  then [[markdown-tour#part
usb-key Right
usb-key Enter
expect [[markdown-tour#Part two]]
# Esc closes the bar; the text stays as typed.
hw  or [[lam
esc
expect-mode write
expect [[lam
shot v1.20-wiki-closed
# Night, landscape.
hw ps]]
tap-on Options
tap-on Dark mode/On
tap-on Orientation/Landscape
tap-on Close
expect-screen 1920x1440
hw  and [[
shot v1.20-wiki-night-landscape
tap-on Suggest0
tap-on Options
tap-on Dark mode/Off
tap-on Orientation/Portrait
tap-on Close
expect-status saved
